<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rdf:RDF xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:adms="http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#" xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:odrl="http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:lcon="http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#" xmlns:sioc="http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/" xmlns:v="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" xmlns:voaf="http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#" xmlns:wdrs="http://www.w3.org/2007/05/powder-s#" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" xmlns:spdx="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#" xmlns:time="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#" xmlns:dcatap="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/" xmlns:stat="http://data.europa.eu/s1n/statdcat-ap/" xmlns:qb="http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#" ><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/products-datasets/-/ten00139"><dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-09-20</dct:issued><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Time frequency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Statistische Systematik der Wirtschaftszweige in der Europäischen Gemeinschaft (NACE Rev. 2)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Statistical classification of economic activities in the European Community (NACE Rev. 2)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Nomenclature statistique des activités économiques dans la Communauté européenne (NACE Rév. 2)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Steuern</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Taxes</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Taxes</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</dcat:keyword><dct:type><skos:Concept  rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dataset-type/STATISTICAL"/></dct:type><dct:title xml:lang="en">Energy taxes</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">&lt;p&gt;The indicator measures the total amount of energy tax revenue in millions of euro for all NACE activities plus households, non-residents and not allocated. This shows the size that the energy taxes take in absolute (currency) terms, to complement the share of energy taxes paid by paying sector.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Energy taxes are one of the four tax categories that make up environmental taxes (the other three being pollution taxes, resource taxes (excluding taxes on oil and gas extraction) and transport taxes). As per environmental taxes, the energy tax base is a physical unit of something that has a proven specific negative impact on the environment, but it is restricted to certain items that are concerning the energy sector, which also includes CO2 taxes.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Energiesteuern</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="fr">&lt;p&gt;L’indicateur mesure le montant total des recettes fiscales sur l&apos;énergie en millions d’euros pour toutes les catégories NACE ainsi que les ménages, les non-résidents et les non affectés. Cela montre l’importance que les taxes sur l’énergie prennent en valeurs absolues (devises), pour compléter la part des taxes sur l’énergie payée par secteur payant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Les taxes sur l’énergie sont l’une des quatre catégories de taxes qui constituent les taxes environnementales (les trois autres étant les taxes sur la pollution, les taxes sur les ressources (excluant les taxes sur l’extraction de pétrole et de gaz) et les taxes sur les transports). Conformément aux taxes environnementales, la base d’imposition sur l’énergie est une unité physique de quelque chose qui a un impact négatif spécifique sur l’environnement, mais il est restreint à certains éléments concernant le secteur énergétique, qui inclut aussi les taxes sur le CO2.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="de">Impôts sur l&apos;énergie</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="de">&lt;p&gt;Der Indikator misst den Gesamtbetrag der Einnahmen aus Energiesteuern in Millionen Euro für alle NACE-Aktivitäten plus Haushalte, Nichtansässige und nicht Zugewiesene. Dies zeigt die Größe, die die Energiesteuern in absoluten (Währungs-) Bedingungen einnehmen, um den Anteil der Energiesteuern zu ergänzen, die von den zahlenden Sektoren gezahlt werden.Energiesteuern sind eine der vier Steuerkategorien, die Umweltsteuern ausmachen (die anderen drei sind Umweltsteuern, Ressourcensteuern (ohne Steuern auf Öl- und Gasförderung) und Transportsteuern). Gemäß den Umweltsteuern ist die Energiesteuergrundlage eine physische Einheit von etwas, das nachweislich spezifische negative Auswirkungen auf die Umwelt hat, aber sie ist auf bestimmte Elemente beschränkt, die den Energiesektor betreffen, wozu auch CO2-Steuern gehören.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:identifier>ten00139</dct:identifier><foaf:page rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/ten00139"/><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EUR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BEL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BGR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CZE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DNK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DEU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EST"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/IRL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/GRC"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ESP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FRA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HRV"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ITA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CYP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LVA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LTU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LUX"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HUN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MLT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NLD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/AUT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Loca